Stock Regime Detector — launcher script.

Full implementation lives in the stock_regime_detector/ package.

Usage:
    python stock_regime_detector.py [options]
    python -m stock_regime_detector [options]

Common options:
    --tickers SPY QQQ AAPL   Tickers to analyse (default: SPY QQQ AAPL)
    --live                   Fetch real data via yfinance
    --n-regimes 3            Fix number of regimes (default: auto 2-6)
    --walk-forward           Re-fit HMM on rolling window
    --smooth 3               Min days to hold a regime label
    --target-vol 0.15        Annualised vol target for position sizing
    --transaction-cost 5e-4  One-way cost per trade (default: 5 bps)
    --outdir outputs         Output directory for charts
    --help                   Show all options

import runpy
import sys
import os

sys.path.insert(0, os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)))
runpy.run_module("stock_regime_detector", run_name="__main__", alter_sys=True)
